  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Bake cannellini beans: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line 2 oven trays with baking paper. Drain and rinse the beans. Combine 1 tsp dried oregano and 1 tbs olive oil in a large bowl. Add the beans, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Spread the beans over a lined tray and bake on the lower oven shelf for 15 mins or until golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1461298/photos/large/prep_ingredients-b0faf339be5cd5aec11fb1032f131adb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Meanwhile, cut the tomatoes into thick wedges. Quarter the cucumber lengthwise, then cut into 2cm chunks. Tear or cut the bread rolls into 3cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1461299/photos/large/make_herby_vinaigrette-be29946f4e15681d4167dc3f3c481cc1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake croutons: Put the bread on the remaining lined tray and spray or brush with olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Bake on the upper shelf for 5-6 mins until golden and crisp.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1461300/photos/large/toss_salad-304dcd0b33eee3613a74c292cba0e3c6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss salad: Put 1 tbs olive oil, 1 tbs red wine vinegar and 1 tsp dijon mustard in a large bowl. Season with salt and pepper and whisk to combine. Add the beans, tomato, cucumber and rocket and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1461301/photos/large/grill_bread-f89f51e954d0186b1891a32c84fd2b08.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Add the croutons to the salad and toss to combine. Taste, then season with salt and pepper. Divide the salad among bowls and crumble over the vegan feta. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1461302/photos/large/serve_up-3928cf83b93a26d1756571a783055c5f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: To add more Greek salad fun, toss in a handful of olives or a sliced red capsicum.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1461303/photos/large/make_it_yours-19fa174b6eb51e6916501f90f36b5527.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
